@BookStore.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104

### List books (defaults: page 1, 10 per page, sorted by title)
GET {{BookStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Page 2 with 5 items per page
GET {{BookStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/books?page=2&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Sort by price, highest first (sortBy: Title, Author, Genre, Price, PublishedYear, Stock)
GET {{BookStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/books?sortBy=Price&descending=true
Accept: application/json

### Invalid paging returns 400 Bad Request
GET {{BookStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/books?page=0&pageSize=500
Accept: application/json

###
